      "top": 0.32510541385328934,
      "width": 0.30981680927923333,
      "height": 0.011834204007243181
    }
  },
  {
    "str": "understanding our past. We study factors that",
    "box": {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "left": 0.14760446196386215,
      "top": 0.3393075039814286,
      "width": 0.3095436624339354,
      "height": 0.011834204007243181
    }
  },
  {
    "str": "shape NLP as a field, including culture, incen-",
    "box": {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "left": 0.14760446196386215,
      "top": 0.35350840624655944,
      "width": 0.3123128894214123,
      "height": 0.011834204007243181
    }
  },
  {
    "str": "tives, and infrastructure by conducting long-",
    "box": {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "left": 0.14760446196386215,
      "top": 0.3677093085116902,
      "width": 0.3123092742425773,
      "height": 0.011834204007243181
    }
  },
  {
    "str": "form interviews with 26 NLP researchers of",
    "box": {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "left": 0.14760446196386215,
      "top": 0.38191021077682097,
      "width": 0.30954366243393533,
      "height": 0.011834204007243181
    }
  },
  {
    "str": "varying seniority, research area, institution, and",
    "box": {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "left": 0.14718614768611538,
      "top": 0.39611111304195173,
      "width": 0.30995237848553947,
      "height": 0.011834204007243181
    }
  },
  {
    "str": "social identity. Our interviewees identify cycli-",
    "box": {
      "pageNumber": 1,
